le":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A resident of the land of Momotaro. He appears to be none other than Momotaro himself, but calls himself “Peach.” He’s a frivolous, superficial playboy. The Monkey, Dog, and Pheasant that follow him are all female and his fuckbuddies (?). He lives with his strangely youthful “Grandmother” and his wild “Grandfather.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation taken from 19.04se.cc"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c48903"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01caef842454add0e53cee47ed212478ee14b837d04a8da6b000679d36eeae33.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a09f3d8d3a0d6e37c8e5ce6bbf77ebf290f070383e86eca3c03db189fb5ebb02.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深川 緑","creatorId":"vndb:s5570","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5570","name":"北山 恭祐","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:66315","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c48904","characterName":"童帝","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c48904"},"originalCharacterName":"童帝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The king who rules the land of Peter Pan. Without any subordinates or a court, he mostly locks himself away in his child-like bedroom. He has an abnormal distaste for romantic relationships and sexual activity between men and women, and has prohibited it by law. He punishes all transgressors